---
const title = 'Zymplo · Memphis Lab · V09';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#FFFCEB" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="https://sims.zymplo.com/brand/isotipo.svg" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:wght@500;700;900&family=Inter:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" />
    <style is:inline>
      :root { --paper: #FFFCEB; --ink: #1A1A2E; --pink: #FF6B9D; --yellow: #FFD93D; --turq: #14B8A6; --orange: #FF8C42; --purple: #9B5DE5; --blue: #4FC3F7; }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); overflow-x: hidden; min-height: 100vh; position: relative; }

      /* Memphis pattern decorations */
      .deco { position: absolute; pointer-events: none; z-index: 1; }
      .squiggle { width: 80px; height: 30px; background: none; border-bottom: 4px solid var(--pink); border-radius: 50%; transform: rotate(-12deg); }
      .triangle { width: 0; height: 0; border-left: 24px solid transparent; border-right: 24px solid transparent; border-bottom: 40px solid var(--turq); }
      .dotgrid { width: 90px; height: 60px; background-image: radial-gradient(circle, var(--ink) 2.5px, transparent 2.5px); background-size: 18px 18px; }
      .zigzag { width: 100px; height: 24px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--orange) 25%, transparent 25%) -8px 0, linear-gradient(225deg, var(--orange) 25%, transparent 25%) -8px 0, linear-gradient(315deg, var(--orange) 25%, transparent 25%), linear-gradient(45deg, var(--orange) 25%, transparent 25%); background-size: 16px 16px; background-color: var(--paper); }
      .circle-bb { width: 60px; height: 60px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--purple); }
      .circle-yy { width: 50px; height: 50px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--yellow); border: 4px solid var(--ink); }
      .blob1 { width: 120px; height: 100px; background: var(--blue); border-radius: 60% 40% 50% 50% / 50% 60% 40% 50%; }

      .nav-back { position: fixed; top: 14px; left: 14px; z-index: 100; padding: 6px 14px 6px 8px; background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); border: 3px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 999px; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 12px; text-decoration: none; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--pink); }
      .nav-back img { height: 16px; filter: brightness(0) invert(1); }
      .lab-badge { position: fixed; top: 14px; right: 14px; z-index: 100; padding: 6px 14px; background: var(--yellow); color: var(--ink); border: 3px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 999px; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 12px; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--ink); }

      .hero { position: relative; z-index: 2; padding: 60px 22px 80px; max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; }
      .pill { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 7px 14px; background: var(--turq); color: var(--ink); border: 3px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 999px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--ink); }

      h1 { font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-size: clamp(48px, 11vw, 168px); line-height: 0.88; letter-spacing: -0.04em; margin: 28px 0; color: var(--ink); position: relative; }
      h1 .word { display: inline-block; }
      h1 .pink-bg { background: var(--pink); padding: 0 14px; border: 4px solid var(--ink); transform: rotate(-1.5deg); display: inline-block; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--ink); }
      h1 .yellow-bg { background: var(--yellow); padding: 0 14px; border: 4px solid var(--ink); transform: rotate(1deg); display: inline-block; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--ink); }
      h1 .turq-bg { background: var(--turq); color: var(--paper); padding: 0 14px; border: 4px solid var(--ink); transform: rotate(-0.6deg); display: inline-block; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--ink); }
      h1 .underline { text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-thickness: 8px; text-decoration-color: var(--orange); text-underline-offset: 6px; }

      .sub { margin-top: 30px; max-width: 600px; font-size: clamp(16px, 1.8vw, 19px); line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 500; }
      .sub strong { background: var(--yellow); padding: 0 4px; }

      .cta-row { margin-top: 36px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; align-items: center; }
      .btn-pink { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 18px 28px; background: var(--pink); color: var(--ink); border: 4px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 999px; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 18px; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--ink); transition: all 0.15s; }
      .btn-pink:hover { transform: translate(-3px, -3px); box-shadow: 9px 9px 0 var(--ink); }
      .btn-pink::after { content: '→'; }
      .btn-out { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 18px 26px; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); border: 4px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 999px; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none; }
      .btn-out:hover { background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); }

      .micro { margin-top: 18px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; }
      .micro span { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 4px 10px; background: var(--paper); border: 2px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 999px; margin-right: 8px; margin-top: 6px; }

      .stats { margin-top: 64px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }
      .st { padding: 20px 22px; border: 4px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 22px; background: var(--paper); position: relative; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--ink); }
      .st:nth-child(1) { background: var(--pink); }
      .st:nth-child(2) { background: var(--yellow); }
      .st:nth-child(3) { background: var(--turq); color: var(--paper); }
      .st:nth-child(4) { background: var(--orange); }
      .st .v { font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px); line-height: 0.92; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
      .st .l { margin-top: 6px; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.1em; }

      .feats { padding: 80px 22px; max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; position: relative; z-index: 2; }
      .feats h2 { font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-size: clamp(34px, 6vw, 72px); letter-spacing: -0.04em; line-height: 0.95; }
      .feats h2 em { font-style: normal; background: var(--turq); color: var(--paper); padding: 0 14px; border: 4px solid var(--ink); display: inline-block; transform: rotate(-1deg); box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--ink); }

      .feat-grid { margin-top: 56px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
      .fc { padding: 28px; background: var(--paper); border: 4px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 24px; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--ink); transition: all 0.18s; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
      .fc:hover { transform: translate(-3px, -3px); box-shadow: 9px 9px 0 var(--ink); }
      .fc:nth-child(1) { background: var(--yellow); }
      .fc:nth-child(2) { background: var(--pink); }
      .fc:nth-child(3) { background: var(--blue); color: var(--ink); }
      .fc:nth-child(4) { background: var(--orange); }
      .fc .ic { font-size: 36px; }
      .fc .t { font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-size: 24px; margin-top: 14px; line-height: 1; }
      .fc .d { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 500; }

      .footer { padding: 40px 22px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; }
      .footer a { color: var(--ink); text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--pink); text-decoration-thickness: 3px; margin: 0 10px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <!-- decoraciones -->
    <div class="deco" style="top: 80px; right: 8%;"><div class="circle-bb"></div></div>
    <div class="deco" style="top: 200px; left: 4%;"><div class="triangle"></div></div>
    <div class="deco" style="top: 480px; right: 14%;"><div class="zigzag"></div></div>
    <div class="deco" style="top: 720px; left: 6%;"><div class="dotgrid"></div></div>
    <div class="deco" style="top: 360px; right: 6%;"><div class="circle-yy"></div></div>
    <div class="deco" style="bottom: 200px; left: 8%;"><div class="blob1"></div></div>
    <div class="deco" style="top: 580px; right: 4%; transform: rotate(35deg);"><div class="squiggle"></div></div>

    <a class="nav-back" href="/lab/"><img src="https://sims.zymplo.com/brand/isotipo.svg" alt="Zymplo" />← Lab</a>
    <a class="lab-badge" href="/lab/">09 · Memphis</a>

    <main class="hero">
      <span class="pill">⚡ EN VIVO · 13 PAÍSES</span>
      <h1>
        <span class="word"><span class="pink-bg">Cobrá</span></span><span class="word"><span class="underline">.</span></span><br/>
        <span class="word">Sin <span class="yellow-bg">perseguir</span>.</span><br/>
        <span class="word">La IA</span> <span class="word"><span class="turq-bg">hace todo</span>.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="sub">Tu secretaria IA dentro de WhatsApp. <strong>Cobra</strong> · <strong>factura</strong> · <strong>agenda</strong> · <strong>organiza</strong>. Sin app · sin signup · sin fricción.</p>

      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn-pink" href="https://wa.me/595981970735?text=Quiero%20probar%20Zymplo">Empezar gratis</a>
        <a class="btn-out" href="#feats">Ver cómo funciona</a>
      </div>
      <div class="micro"><span>✓ Sin app</span><span>✓ Sin registro</span><span>✓ Gratis para siempre</span></div>

      <div class="stats">
        <div class="st"><div class="v">$ 47.28M</div><div class="l">cobrados / mes</div></div>
        <div class="st"><div class="v">12.847</div><div class="l">activos hoy</div></div>
        <div class="st"><div class="v">13</div><div class="l">países</div></div>
        <div class="st"><div class="v">847</div><div class="l">se sumaron hoy</div></div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <section class="feats" id="feats">
      <h2>Todo lo que <em>odiás hacer</em>.<br/>Sin que lo pidas.</h2>
      <div class="feat-grid">
        <div class="fc"><div class="ic">💸</div><div class="t">Cobra sin perseguir</div><div class="d">Detecta facturas vencidas. Manda recordatorios calientes que cobran. Te avisa cuando entró la plata.</div></div>
        <div class="fc"><div class="ic">🧾</div><div class="t">Facturá hablando</div><div class="d">"Hacé factura a Pablo por 850.000". Listo. NFS-e · CFDI · DIAN · AFIP.</div></div>
        <div class="fc"><div class="ic">📅</div><div class="t">Agenda en tu cabeza</div><div class="d">"Recordame mañana 9 ir al taller". Llega el aviso. Punto. Nunca olvidás nada.</div></div>
        <div class="fc"><div class="ic">⚡</div><div class="t">24/7 sin parar</div><div class="d">Zé no duerme · no se enferma · no se va de vacaciones. Trabaja por vos siempre.</div></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="footer">
      © 2026 Zymplo · Memphis Pop Edition · <a href="/lab/">Lab</a> · <a href="/">Landing</a> · <a href="/lab/v10/">V10 →</a>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
